# ===== Stage Editor top menu (Adobe style) =====
# ===== Menu titles =====
menu_stage => Stage / 舞台
menu_object => Object / 对象
menu_camera => Camera / 相机
menu_view => View / 视图
menu_file => File / 文件
menu_help => Help / 帮助

# ===== Status bar =====
status_stage => Stage: / 舞台:
status_directory => Dir: / 目录:
status_object => Object: / 对象:
status_pos => Pos: / 坐标:
status_zoom => Zoom: / 缩放:

# ===== Items: Stage menu =====
item_stage_select => Stage / 舞台
item_reload_stage => Reload Stage / 重新加载舞台
item_load_template => Load Template / 加载模板
item_directory => Asset Directory / 资源目录
item_hide_gf => Hide Girlfriend / 隐藏女友
item_default_zoom => Default Zoom / 默认缩放
item_cam_speed => Camera Speed / 相机速度
label_stage_select => Stage: / 舞台:
label_directory => Directory: / 资源目录:
label_default_zoom => Default Zoom: / 默认缩放:
label_cam_speed => Camera Speed: / 相机速度:
desc_stage_select => Select the stage to edit. Switching stages rebuilds the editor (stability first). / 选择要编辑的舞台。切换舞台会重建编辑器（稳定优先）。
desc_reload_stage => Reload the current stage JSON and background from disk. / 从磁盘重新加载当前舞台的 JSON 与背景。
desc_load_template => Replace current stage data with a blank template. / 用空白模板替换当前舞台数据。
desc_directory => Asset directory for this stage (e.g. week1 / week4), decides which week folder loads images. / 该舞台的资源目录（如 week1 / week4），决定图片从哪个周目录加载。
desc_hide_gf => Hide the girlfriend character on stage. / 在舞台上隐藏女友角色。
desc_default_zoom => Default camera zoom for this stage. / 舞台的默认相机缩放值。
desc_cam_speed => Camera follow speed multiplier. / 相机跟随速度倍率。

# ===== Items: Object menu =====
label_obj_name => Name: / 名称:
label_obj_type => Type: / 类型:
label_obj_image => Image: / 图片:
label_obj_pos => Position: / 坐标:
label_obj_scale => Scale: / 缩放:
label_obj_alpha => Alpha: / 透明度:
label_obj_angle => Angle: / 角度:
item_obj_new_sprite => New Sprite (Image) / 新建精灵（图片）
item_obj_new_animated => New Animated Sprite / 新建动画精灵
item_obj_new_square => New Solid Color / 新建纯色方块
item_obj_delete => Delete Object / 删除对象
item_obj_duplicate => Duplicate Object / 复制对象
item_obj_anim => Open Animation Editor / 打开动画编辑器
item_obj_move_up => Move Up a Layer / 上移一层
item_obj_move_down => Move Down a Layer / 下移一层
desc_obj_name => Name of the currently selected object (for Lua/HScript). / 当前选中对象的名称（供 Lua/HScript 引用）。
desc_obj_type => Type of the selected object (sprite / animatedSprite / square / character). / 当前选中对象的类型（sprite / animatedSprite / square / 角色）。
desc_obj_image => Image asset used by the selected object. / 当前选中对象使用的图片资源名。
desc_obj_pos => X / Y position of the selected object. / 当前选中对象的 X / Y 坐标。
desc_obj_scale => X / Y scale of the selected object. / 当前选中对象的 X / Y 缩放。
desc_obj_alpha => Opacity of the selected object (0% - 100%). / 当前选中对象的透明度（0% - 100%）。
desc_obj_angle => Rotation angle of the selected object. / 当前选中对象的旋转角度。
desc_obj_new_sprite => Pick an image from the images/ folder to create a plain sprite. / 从 images/ 目录选择一张图片创建普通精灵。
desc_obj_new_animated => Pick a sprite with an XML/JSON/TXT animation file from images/. / 从 images/ 目录选择带 XML/JSON/TXT 动画文件的精灵。
desc_obj_new_square => Create a 200x200 solid color block. / 创建一个 200x200 的纯色方块。
desc_obj_delete => Delete the selected background object (characters can't be deleted). / 删除当前选中的背景对象（角色不可删除）。
desc_obj_duplicate => Duplicate the selected object and insert it into the list. / 复制当前选中的对象并插入到列表。
desc_obj_anim => Open the animation editor substate to edit frames/offsets. / 打开动画编辑子状态，编辑动画帧/偏移。
desc_obj_move_up => Move the selected object one layer up in the render order. / 将选中对象在渲染层级中上移一层。
desc_obj_move_down => Move the selected object one layer down in the render order. / 将选中对象在渲染层级中下移一层。
item_show_bf => Show Player (BF) / 显示玩家 (BF)
item_show_dad => Show Opponent (Opp) / 显示对手 (Opp)
item_show_gf => Show Girlfriend (GF) / 显示女友 (GF)
desc_show_bf => Show or hide the Boyfriend character. / 显示或隐藏玩家角色（Boyfriend）。
desc_show_dad => Show or hide the Opponent character. / 显示或隐藏对手角色（Opponent）。
desc_show_gf => Show or hide the Girlfriend character (syncs Hide Girlfriend data). / 显示或隐藏女友角色（Girlfriend，同步 Hide Girlfriend 数据）。
desc_obj_list_item => Click to select this object (syncs with W/S selection). / 点击选中该对象（与 W/S 选择同步）。

# ===== Items: Camera menu =====
label_cam_zoom => Zoom: / 缩放:
label_cam_target => Target: / 目标:
label_cam_bf_x => Player X: / 玩家 X:
label_cam_bf_y => Player Y: / 玩家 Y:
label_cam_dad_x => Opponent X: / 对手 X:
label_cam_dad_y => Opponent Y: / 对手 Y:
label_cam_gf_x => Girlfriend X: / 女友 X:
label_cam_gf_y => Girlfriend Y: / 女友 Y:
desc_cam_zoom => Current camera zoom (applies live while editing). / 当前相机缩放值（编辑时实时生效）。
desc_cam_target => Camera follow target (player / opponent / girlfriend). / 相机跟随目标（玩家 / 对手 / 女友）。
desc_cam_offset => Camera offset when focusing that character. / 相机聚焦该角色时的偏移量。

# ===== Items: View menu =====
item_low_quality => Show Low Quality Sprites / 显示低质量精灵
item_high_quality => Show High Quality Sprites / 显示高质量精灵
item_toggle_help => Toggle Help / 显示/隐藏帮助
item_focus_bf => Focus Player / 聚焦玩家
item_focus_dad => Focus Opponent / 聚焦对手
item_focus_gf => Focus Girlfriend / 聚焦女友
desc_low_quality => Show background sprites marked as low quality. / 是否显示标记为低质量的背景精灵。
desc_high_quality => Show background sprites marked as high quality. / 是否显示标记为高质量的背景精灵。
desc_toggle_help => Show or hide the shortcut help overlay. / 显示或隐藏快捷键帮助浮层。
desc_focus_bf => Move camera to the player character. / 相机移动到玩家角色。
desc_focus_dad => Move camera to the opponent character. / 相机移动到对手角色。
desc_focus_gf => Move camera to the girlfriend character. / 相机移动到女友角色。

# ===== Items: File menu =====
item_save => Save / 保存
desc_save => Save the current stage JSON (objects and camera data) to a file. / 保存当前舞台 JSON（含对象与相机数据）到文件。

# ===== Help menu =====
help_camera => Navigation / 导航操作
item_tutorial => Tutorial / 新手教程
desc_tutorial => Open the beginner tutorial: stage background setup, importing assets, saving, etc. / 打开新手教程：舞台背景设置、导入素材、保存等基础操作指南。
help_cam_zoom => Q / E - Zoom out / in / Q / E - 缩小 / 放大
help_cam_move => J / K / L / I - Move camera / J / K / L / I - 移动相机
help_cam_reset => R - Reset zoom / R - 重置缩放
desc_help_camera => Camera navigation: Q/E zoom, J/K/L/I move, R reset. / 相机导航：Q/E 缩放，J/K/L/I 移动，R 重置。
desc_help_cam_zoom => Q / E - zoom the camera out / in. / Q / E - 缩小 / 放大相机。
desc_help_cam_move => J / K / L / I - move the camera. / J / K / L / I - 移动相机。
desc_help_cam_reset => R - reset camera zoom to the stage default. / R - 重置相机缩放为舞台默认值。
help_obj => Object Controls / 对象操作
help_obj_move => Arrow keys - Move selected object / 方向键 - 移动选中对象
help_obj_sel => W / S - Switch selection / W / S - 切换选中对象
help_obj_scale => Shift - 4x movement / Shift - 4 倍速移动
desc_help_obj => Object editing: arrow keys move, W/S switch selection. / 对象编辑：方向键移动，W/S 切换选择。
desc_help_obj_move => Arrow keys - move the selected object in 5px steps. / 方向键 - 以 5px 步长移动选中的对象。
desc_help_obj_sel => W / S - switch selection in the object list. / W / S - 在对象列表中切换选择。
desc_help_obj_scale => Hold Shift - movement steps become 4x. / 按住 Shift - 移动步长变为 4 倍。
help_other => Other / 其他
help_other_shift => Shift - Speed up / Shift - 加速
help_other_help => F7 - Help / F7 - 帮助
help_other_exit => Esc - Back to menu / Esc - 返回主菜单
desc_help_other => Other common actions. / 其他常用操作。
desc_help_other_shift => Hold Shift - speed up camera/object movement. / 按住 Shift - 相机/对象移动加速。
desc_help_other_help => F7 - show or hide the help overlay. / F7 - 显示或隐藏帮助。
desc_help_other_exit => Esc - exit the editor back to the main menu. / Esc - 退出编辑器返回主菜单。
